{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/freebsd/freebsd-src/compare/main...143293c14f8de00c6d3de88cd23fc224e7014206","html_url":"https://github.com/freebsd/freebsd-src/compare/main...143293c14f8de00c6d3de88cd23fc224e7014206","permalink_url":"https://github.com/freebsd/freebsd-src/compare/freebsd:efa14ab...freebsd:143293c","diff_url":"https://github.com/freebsd/freebsd-src/compare/main...143293c14f8de00c6d3de88cd23fc224e7014206.diff","patch_url":"https://github.com/freebsd/freebsd-src/compare/main...143293c14f8de00c6d3de88cd23fc224e7014206.patch","base_commit":{"sha":"efa14ab698fe5c3a1586aec006f98e3781f4af78","node_id":"C_kwDOACOGddoAKGVmYTE0YWI2OThmZTVjM2ExNTg2YWVjMDA2Zjk4ZTM3ODFmNGFmNzg","commit":{"author":{"name":"Pouria Mousavizadeh Tehrani","email":"pouria@FreeBSD.org","date":"2026-11-12T21:34:06Z"},"committer":{"name":"Pouria Mousavizadeh Tehrani","email":"pouria@FreeBSD.org","date":"2026-11-12T21:48:57Z"},"message":"routing: Fix nhop double free in rib_copy_route()\n\nadd_route_flags() consumes the nexthop reference on every\nfailure path, so nhop_free() in rib_copy_route() releases it for\nthe second time.\n\nThis is reachable when growing net.fibs while two existing fibs\nhold the same pinned prefix.\n\nMFC after:\t3 days\nFixes:\t40503b792f7e (\"routing: populate fibs with interface...\")","tree":{"sha":"a17d640cceb41b23f4a41daa128790fc9dfb0619","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/freebsd/freebsd-src/git/trees/a17d640cceb41b23f4a41daa128790fc9dfb0619"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/freebsd/freebsd-src/git/commits/efa14ab698fe5c3a1586aec006f98e3781f4af78","comment_count":0,"verification":{"verified":true,"reason":"valid","signature":"-----BEGIN PGP SIGNATURE-----\n\niJEEABYKADkWIQSqt7cppfvJ816gj0lUwVnUeMwagAUCavY0ThsUgAAAAAAEAA5t\nYW51MiwyLjUrMS4xMiwyLDMACgkQVMFZ1HjMGoDXmwD/S250Nzp3EO2yaQZ6rmPM\n9PPusn+LFtEWVC6wchwXjUcA/i9dKAXzmT8jGeguTXs20j8qFE4AC4krLm1NQl6v\neZ8P\n=sSYt\n-----END PGP SIGNATURE-----","payload":"tree a17d640cceb41b23f4a41daa128790fc9dfb0619\nparent 1555dff3bf5619278c80ba843555ac2c84d671c3\nauthor Pouria Mousavizadeh Tehrani <pouria@FreeBSD.org> 1794519246 +0330\ncommitter Pouria Mousavizadeh Tehrani <pouria@FreeBSD.org> 1794520137 +0330\n\nrouting: Fix nhop double free in rib_copy_route()\n\nadd_route_flags() consumes the nexthop reference on every\nfailure path, so nhop_free() in rib_copy_route() releases it for\nthe second time.\n\nThis is reachable when growing net.fibs while two existing fibs\nhold the same pinned prefix.\n\nMFC after:\t3 days\nFixes:\t40503b792f7e (\"routing: populate fibs with interface...\")\n","verified_at":"2026-11-12T22:00:14Z"}},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/freebsd/freebsd-src/commits/efa14ab698fe5c3a1586aec006f98e3781f4af78","html_url":"https://github.com/freebsd/freebsd-src/commit/efa14ab698fe5c3a1586aec006f98e3781f4af78","comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/freebsd/freebsd-src/commits/efa14ab698fe5c3a1586aec006f98e3781f4af78/comments","author":{"login":"spmzt","id":23587632,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjIzNTg3NjMy","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/23587632?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/spmzt","html_url":"https://github.com/spmzt","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/spmzt/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/spmzt/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/spmzt/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/spmzt/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/spmzt/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/spmzt/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/spmzt/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/spmzt/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/spmzt/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"committer":{"login":"spmzt","id":23587632,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjIzNTg3NjMy","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/23